			<item>
				<title>Code Optimization Demo &amp; Reading Time</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/en/posts/code-optimization/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>me@example.org (Your Name)</author>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/en/posts/code-optimization/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;code-optimization-demo--reading-time&#34;&gt;Code Optimization Demo &amp;amp; Reading Time&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This page demonstrates &lt;strong&gt;code blocks (syntax highlighting + language label + copy button)&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;reading time / word count&lt;/strong&gt; on a longer body. It also shows the common &amp;ldquo;before vs. after&amp;rdquo; optimization pattern.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;scenario-summing-optimization&#34;&gt;Scenario: summing optimization&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A plain Python implementation is intuitive, but readability and edge-case handling can be improved.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Before (naive loop):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-python&#34; data-lang=&#34;python&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;sum_before&lt;/span&gt;(n):&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    total &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; i &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; range(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;, n &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;):&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;        total &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;+=&lt;/span&gt; i&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; total&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;After (Gauss formula, O(1), with input guard):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Media &amp; Shortcodes Test</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/en/posts/media-and-shortcodes/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>me@example.org (Your Name)</author>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/en/posts/media-and-shortcodes/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;media--shortcodes-test&#34;&gt;Media &amp;amp; Shortcodes Test&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This page exercises &lt;strong&gt;shortcodes&lt;/strong&gt;: audio, video, YouTube, and Bilibili.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;audio-audio-shortcode&#34;&gt;Audio (audio shortcode)&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;audio&lt;/code&gt; shortcode renders a native &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;audio&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; player. Usage:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-html&#34; data-lang=&#34;html&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;audio controls preload=&#34;none&#34; style=&#34;width:100%&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;source src=&#34;audio-source-url&#34; type=&#34;audio/mpeg&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Your browser does not support the audio element.&#xA;&lt;/audio&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Actual call:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;audio controls preload=&#34;none&#34; style=&#34;width:100%&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;source src=&#34;https://www.soundhelix.com/examples/mp3/SoundHelix-Song-1.mp3&#34; type=&#34;audio/mpeg&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Your browser does not support the audio element.&#xA;&lt;/audio&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;video-video-shortcode&#34;&gt;Video (video shortcode)&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;video&lt;/code&gt; shortcode renders a native &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;video&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; player (MDN public sample). Usage:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-html&#34; data-lang=&#34;html&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;video controls preload=&#34;metadata&#34;  style=&#34;width:100%&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;source src=&#34;video-source-url&#34; type=&#34;video/mp4&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Your browser does not support the video element.&#xA;&lt;/video&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Actual call:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
